# Raw BlaBlaCar source exports sitting in the repo root (~59MB). Ignored on
# 23 Jul 2026, Laura's call.
#
# Every one of these is the ORIGINAL of an asset that is already optimised,
# committed and live under public/case-studies/blablacar/. Verified by matching
# pixel dimensions, not by filename:
#   Quote_Coffee_02.jpg           1.0MB  →  blablacar-coffee-quote.jpg    75KB
#   Group_Selfie_01_…Portrait.jpg 548KB  →  blablacar-group-selfie.jpg   107KB
#   New_Year_Countdown_…1200x717  232KB  →  blablacar-countdown-post.jpg  37KB
#   bla_bla_car_pattern.png        32KB  →  blablacar-quote-pattern.png   32KB
#   Diver-vertical-V04.gif        9.9MB  →  blablacar-diver.mp4          448KB
# The site loads ~2.8MB of optimised media for this case study; these are 58MB
# of source for the same material, and nothing in src/ or public/ references
# them.
#
# Ignored rather than committed because the repo history was cleaned once and
# must not be rewritten again — 59MB added here would be permanent. Ignored
# rather than left loose so they cannot be swept in by a stray `git add -A`.
#
# NOTE: git is therefore not backing these up. They are BlaBlaCar's own
# marketing assets so they are recoverable, but if they matter, keep a copy
# somewhere outside this repo.
/*.mp4
/*.gif
/Quote_Coffee_02.jpg
/Group_Selfie_01_FACEBOOK__Portrait.jpg
/New_Year_Countdown_Together_Organic_FB-post_1200x717.jpg
/bla_bla_car_pattern.png

